  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NHO-CEC Capacity Building of Regional CEC Offices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will give capacity building to support the follow up of the SDG no 8 to selected provincial offices of China Enterprise Confederation in the Western and Southern region of China. The project is divided into and focuses on the following topics: 1) The tripartite consultation mechanism 2) Human Resources services 3) Research and policy papers 4) Recruitment and membership services. These topics will be covered in a number of trainings, study trips and workshops.</narrative>
  </description>
